{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are Major Axel Vex, a veteran of Extraterrestrial Incident Response, dispatched to investigate a distress signal from Cengona Base - an  underground research facility on a distant exoplanet. What begins as a routine investigation quickly spirals into a desperate battle for survival against an entity that turns both mind and matter against you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SURVIVE THE DEPTHS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Navigate through 26 unique sectors of a massive underground base, each with its own dangers and secrets<br>\u2022 Manage your resources and choose your battles wisely against sinister entities <br>\u2022 Uncover the truth through recovered logs, security footage, and the haunting remains of the base's personnel</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372090/extras/8232a444aa9240a804c98310bdb97d20.poster.avif?t=1761810589\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372090/extras/8232a444aa9240a804c98310bdb97d20.webm?t=1761810589\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372090/extras/8232a444aa9240a804c98310bdb97d20.mp4?t=1761810589\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FACE THE INFECTION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Confront hostile entities that are controlled by a mysterious biological force<br>\u2022 Experience dynamic horror that adapts to your actions and decisions<br>\u2022 Solve environmental puzzles while avoiding detection by creatures that hunt through light and movement</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372090/extras/bb7b2254ad75b2b33ddafaf9b7390fc5.poster.avif?t=1761810589\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372090/extras/bb7b2254ad75b2b33ddafaf9b7390fc5.webm?t=1761810589\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372090/extras/bb7b2254ad75b2b33ddafaf9b7390fc5.mp4?t=1761810589\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Unique blend of psychological and biological horror<br>\u2022 Atmospheric survival horror set in a claustrophobic underground facility<br>\u2022 Strategic resource management<br>\u2022 Immersive sound design that heightens tension and aids survival<br>\u2022 Rich narrative told through environmental storytelling</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372090/extras/9b99d11611b052a74f602648d471a413.poster.avif?t=1761810589\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372090/extras/9b99d11611b052a74f602648d471a413.webm?t=1761810589\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372090/extras/9b99d11611b052a74f602648d471a413.mp4?t=1761810589\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf3f <strong>Can you resist the breach?</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ABOUT THE DEVELOPER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >HELL OF FEAR: Mind Breach is a game designed by Tayfun Tuna and developed by Cenk Bilgin. It represents our vision of a new era in psychological survival horror. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Note:</strong> This game contains scenes of intense horror, violence, and psychological distress. Player discretion is advised.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3372090?t=1761810589","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372090/2b3ef92776dea9e8100aa8d5ca013b9d48ccee05/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761810589","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372090/7e80bd6dc3d5ed61b2add232e1d66117dccff71f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761810589","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372090/7e80bd6dc3d5ed61b2add232e1d66117dccff71f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761810589","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Battle against alien monsters, much like \"Dead Space\" series."},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3490900,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are Major Axel Vex, a veteran of Extraterrestrial Incident Response, dispatched to investigate a distress signal from Cengona Base - an  underground research facility on a distant exoplanet. What begins as a routine investigation quickly spirals into a desperate battle for survival against an entity that turns both mind and matter against you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SURVIVE THE DEPTHS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Navigate through 26 unique sectors of a massive underground base, each with its own dangers and secrets<br>\u2022 Manage your resources and choose your battles wisely