tmospheric survival horror set in a claustrophobic underground facility<br>\u2022 Strategic resource management<br>\u2022 Immersive sound design that heightens tension and aids survival<br>\u2022 Rich narrative told through environmental storytelling</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372090/extras/9b99d11611b052a74f602648d471a413.poster.avif?t=1761810589\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372090/extras/9b99d11611b052a74f602648d471a413.webm?t=1761810589\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372090/extras/9b99d11611b052a74f602648d471a413.mp4?t=1761810589\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf3f <strong>Can you resist the breach?</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ABOUT THE DEVELOPER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >HELL OF FEAR: Mind Breach is a game designed by Tayfun Tuna and developed by Cenk Bilgin. It represents our vision of a new era in psychological survival horror. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Note:</strong> This game contains scenes of intense horror, violence, and psychological distress. Player discretion is advised.</p>","developers":["Abyss Assembly"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372090/5d4661c867a194b37c82bc360ad6350cb7b5c464/header.jpg?t=1761810589","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommen